s calibrated run (green solid, 25 steps → 0.82)\n- Canvas-based rendering with theme variable support\n\n### C. Agentic Build — PARTIALLY COMPLETED (5 of 9 files done)\n\n**Files CREATED (done):**\n1. `smartagent/agent/__init__.py` — Package init, exposes `SmartAgent`\n2. `smartagent/agent/prompts.py` — ReAct system prompt with tool description injection, chat greeting\n3. `smartagent/agent/memory.py` — Sliding-window conversation memory (dataclass, max 20 messages, finding accumulation, file tracking)\n4. `smartagent/agent/tools.py` — 8 security tools (list_files, read_file, search_code, scan_code, get_cwe_info, write_report, run_command, fix_code) + embedded CWE database (12 entries) + sandboxed command allowlist\n5. `smartagent/agent/core.py` — ReAct agent loop (`SmartAgent` class) with Thought/Action/Observation parsing, max 15 iterations, lazy model loading, Rich terminal display\n\n**Files NOT YET MODIFIED (remaining):**\n6. `smartagent/ai/model.py` — ✅ DONE: Fixed `Tuple[Any, Any]` import, added `generate_stream()` with `TextIteratorStreamer` for real-time token streaming\n7. `smartagent/config.py` — ❌ NOT DONE: Need to add `max_agent_iterations`, `agent_temperature`, `memory_window`, `allowed_commands` fields\n8. `smartagent/cli.py` — ❌ NOT DONE: Need to add `chat` and `agent` commands\n9. `pyproject.toml` — ❌ NOT DONE: Need to add `prompt_toolkit>=3.0.0` dependency\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### SmartAGENT Architecture (existing codebase)\n- **Entry point:** `smartagent/cli.py` — Typer CLI with `scan`, `train`, `info` commands. App registered as `smartagent` in `pyproject.toml` `[project.scripts]`.\n- **Scanner pipeline:** `cli.py` → walks files → runs `ALL_SCANNERS` (PatternScanner, SecretScanner, DependencyScanner, ConfigScanner) → optionally sends findings through `AIJudge` for LLM verification → outputs via Rich/JSON/Markdown reporters.\n- **`ModelManager`** in `smartagent/ai/model.py` — Singleton, loads `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` with 4-bit quantization via bitsandbytes. Now includes `generate_stream()` method.\n- **`AIJudge`** in `smartagent/ai/judge.py` — Takes static findings, sends each to LLM with code context for TRUE/FALSE POSITIVE classification. Parses structured output (Status, Refined Severity, Fix block).\n- **`Finding`** data model in `smartagent/scanners/base.py` — Pydantic BaseModel with id, title, cwe, owasp, severity, cvss, file_path, line_number, snippet, description, remediation, scanner_name, ai_verified, is_false_positive.\n- **`ScannerConfig`** in `smartagent/config.py` — Pydantic config with model_id, load_in_4bit, target_extensions, ignored_directories, max_file_size_kb, output_format.\n\n### New Agent Architecture (being built)\n- **`SmartAgent`** class in `smartagent/agent/core.py` — Main agent with `run()` and `chat()` methods. Uses `ToolRegistry` and `AgentMemory`. Lazy-loads `ModelManager`. ReAct loop: parse LLM output → extract Thought/Action/ActionInput/FinalAnswer → dispatch tool → inject Observation → repeat.\n- **`ToolRegistry`** in `smartagent/agent/tools.py` — Register/execute pattern. Tools return strings. Output capped at 4000 chars. Working directory scoped.\n- **`AgentMemory`** in `smartagent/agent/memory.py` — Dataclass with sliding window (preserves system message, trims rest to last N).\n- **ReAct prompt format:** `Thought: ... \\n Action: tool_name \\n Action Input: input_string` or `Thought: ... \\n Final Answer: ...`. Observations injected as user messages.\n- **Tool sandboxing:** `run_command` uses prefix allowlist: python, pip, git, cat, type, dir, ls, find, grep, rg, fd, wc, head, tail, echo, smartagent. 30s timeout.\n\n### VRAM Constraint\n- GTX 1650 = 4GB VRAM. Model loads in 4-bit (~1.8GB). ReAct loop keeps reasoning chains short (max 15 iterations). Memory sliding window prevents context overflow.\n\n### Colab DOM Architecture (retained for reference)\n- Cell IDs documented in prior checkpoint. Colab MCP server available but Chrome DevTools MCP was more reliable.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\agent\\__init__.py`** — CREATED. Package init exposing `SmartAgent`.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\agent\\prompts.py`** — CREATED. ReAct system prompt template with `{tool_descriptions}` placeholder, observation prefix, continue prompt, chat greeting.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\agent\\memory.py`** — CREATED. `AgentMemory` dataclass with sliding window, finding/file tracking.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\agent\\tools.py`** — CREATED. `ToolRegistry` class with 8 tools + `CWE_DATABASE` dict (12 CWEs) + `ALLOWED_COMMANDS` list + `IGNORE_DIRS` set.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\agent\\core.py`** — CREATED. `SmartAgent` class with `run()`, `chat()`, `reset()`, `_parse_output()`.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\ai\\model.py`** — MODIFIED. Added `Any`, `Generator` imports, `TextIteratorStreamer`, `Thread` imports. Added `generate_stream()` method (~25 lines at end of file).\n\n### Viewed Files (still relevant)\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\cli.py`** (174 lines) — Typer app with `scan`, `train`, `info` commands. **NEEDS MODIFICATION**: Add `chat` and `agent` commands. The `scan` command is at lines 38-121, `train` at 124-139, `info` at 142-169.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartagent\\config.py`** (54 lines) — `ScannerConfig` Pydantic model. **NEEDS MODIFICATION**: Add agent-specific fields (`max_agent_iterations`, `agent_temperature`, `memory_window`, `allowed_commands`).\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\pyproject.toml`** (50 lines) — Dependencies at lines 17-31. **NEEDS MODIFICATION**: Add `prompt_toolkit>=3.0.0` to dependencies.\n- **`c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\smartage